      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600">
        <li><strong>60 days:</strong> Review internal audit results, management review minutes, corrective action effectiveness, AI system inventory, risk register currency</li>
        <li><strong>30 days:</strong> Gather sampled clause/control evidence, update SOA, prepare management presentation, verify documentation accessibility</li>
        <li><strong>7 days:</strong> Final document checklist, auditor liaison, travel arrangements, internal pre-audit briefing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-yellow-50 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200 p-4">
      <p class="text-yellow-700 text-sm mb-3">Common surveillance findings and how to avoid them:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-yellow-700">
        <li>Stale risk register — update after every significant AI system change</li>
        <li>Impact assessments not refreshed after model change — schedule periodic re-assessment</li>
        <li>Management review missing required inputs — use the Clause 9.3 two-column table</li>
        <li>Internal audit not covering all clauses — use the risk-based 3-year plan</li>
        <li>Untracked new AI systems — log new systems in inventory immediately, assess risk promptly</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg border border-red-200 p-4">
      <p class="text-red-700 text-sm mb-3">Consequences of unresolved major NCs (described neutrally):</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-red-700">
        <li>Nonconformity that endangers the validity of the certificate may lead to suspension</li>
        <li>Persistent unresolved major NCs may lead to certificate withdrawal</li>
        <li>CB may require corrective action plan with specified deadline before allowing continuation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
